{
  "app_id": 3582250,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Farm to Table is a farming and restaurant management sim where you build a restaurant from scratch and grow food in the backyard. Explore a colourful island where you can grow and gather food, raise animals, go fishing, produce better food with machines and cook delicious recipes for your hungry guests! Build and customise your dream place, hire staff and grow your organic business into a 5-star restaurant! Build From Scratch Build your restaurant from scratch on a coastal hill overlooking a colorful island! Customize each corner of your kitchen and farm, indoors or outdoors. Choose from a wide variety of wall, flooring, window, decoration, and furniture styles. Grow, Raise & Harvest Grow fresh crops and raise animals right by your kitchen! Collect fresh produce and adopt pet companions. One harvest at a time! Cook & Serve Cook and Serve or Sell at your Farmers’ Market. Discover new recipes by exploring ingredients on the island! Create diverse menus, cook, bake, grill and serve flavoursome dishes to raise your reputation and attract even more customers! Gather & Fish Gather all kinds of wild flavours like mushrooms, berries and much more or go fishing in the open seas for rare catches! Produce Get useful machines to turn harvest into more advanced ingredients and unlock new recipes. Manage Manage resources, hire chefs, waiters and farmers, upgrade and grow the reputation of your place.Take it slow on the farm, then pick up the pace in the kitchen, turn your cozy humble spot into a 5-star restaurant!",
    "zh-Hant": "Farm to Table 是一款农场与餐厅经营模拟游戏：从零开始建造餐厅，在后院种植食材。探索色彩缤纷的小岛，在这里你可以种植与采集食物、饲养动物、出海钓鱼、用机器加工出更高级的食材，并为饥肠辘辘的客人烹饪美味菜谱！建造并自定义你的梦想店铺，雇佣员工，把你的有机事业发展成五星级餐厅！ 从零开始建造 在俯瞰彩色小岛的海岸山坡上，从零建起你的餐厅！室内室外都能自由定制，打造厨房与农场的每个角落。多种墙面、地板、窗户、装饰与家具风格任你选择。 种植、饲养与收获 就在厨房旁边种植新鲜作物、饲养动物！收集新鲜农产品，还能领养宠物伙伴。一次一份地收获！ 烹饪与招待 烹饪并上桌招待，或在农夫集市出售。探索小岛食材，发现新菜谱！打造多样菜单，烹饪、烘焙、烧烤并端上美味佳肴，提升口碑，吸引更多顾客！ 采集与钓鱼 采集蘑菇、浆果等各种野味，或前往外海钓取稀有渔获！ 加工生产 获得实用机器，把收获加工成更高级的食材，解锁新菜谱。 经营管理 管理资源，雇佣厨师、服务员与农夫，升级店铺并提升声望。农场慢慢来，厨房加快节奏，把温馨的小店做成五星餐厅！",
    "zh-Hans": "Farm to Table 是一款农场与餐厅经营模拟游戏：从零开始建造餐厅，在后院种植食材。探索色彩缤纷的小岛，在这里你可以种植与采集食物、饲养动物、出海钓鱼、用机器加工出更高级的食材，并为饥肠辘辘的客人烹饪美味菜谱！建造并自定义你的梦想店铺，雇佣员工，把你的有机事业发展成五星级餐厅！ 从零开始建造 在俯瞰彩色小岛的海岸山坡上，从零建起你的餐厅！室内室外都能自由定制，打造厨房与农场的每个角落。多种墙面、地板、窗户、装饰与家具风格任你选择。 种植、饲养与收获 就在厨房旁边种植新鲜作物、饲养动物！收集新鲜农产品，还能领养宠物伙伴。一次一份地收获！ 烹饪与招待 烹饪并上桌招待，或在农夫集市出售。探索小岛食材，发现新菜谱！打造多样菜单，烹饪、烘焙、烧烤并端上美味佳肴，提升口碑，吸引更多顾客！ 采集与钓鱼 采集蘑菇、浆果等各种野味，或前往外海钓取稀有渔获！ 加工生产 获得实用机器，把收获加工成更高级的食材，解锁新菜谱。 经营管理 管理资源，雇佣厨师、服务员与农夫，升级店铺并提升声望。农场慢慢来，厨房加快节奏，把温馨的小店做成五星餐厅！",
    "ja": "「 Farm to Table 」は、ゼロからレストランを作り、裏庭で食材を育てる農業＆レストラン経営シミュレーション。カラフルな島を探索し、栽培・採集・動物飼育・釣り・マシン生産を楽しみながら、空腹のお客さまのために美味しいレシピを調理しよう！理想の空間を建ててカスタマイズし、スタッフを雇い、オーガニックなお店を5つ星レストランへ成長させよう！ ゼロから建てよう 色鮮やかな島を見下ろす海沿いの丘に、レストランをゼロから建設！屋内・屋外どちらも、キッチンと農場の隅々までカスタマイズ。壁、床、窓、装飾、家具など多彩なスタイルから選べる。 育てて、飼って、収穫 キッチンのすぐそばで作物を育て、動物を飼育！新鮮な収穫物を集めたり、ペットの相棒を迎えたり。収穫は一度にひとつずつ！ 料理して、提供 料理して提供、またはファーマーズマーケットで販売！島の食材を探検して新レシピを発見しよう。多彩なメニューを作り、調理・ベイク・グリルで美味しい料理を提供して評判アップ、さらにお客さまを呼び込もう！ 採取＆釣り きのこやベリーなどの野生の味を採集したり、外海でレアな魚を釣ったり！ 生産 収穫物をより高度な素材に変える便利なマシンを手に入れ、新レシピを解放しよう。 マネジメント 資源を管理し、シェフ・ウェイター・農夫を雇用。拡張しながら評判を高めよう。農場ではのんびり、キッチンではスピードアップ。居心地のいい小さなお店を5つ星へ！",
    "ko": "Farm to Table 은 레스토랑을 처음부터 직접 짓고, 뒷마당에서 식재료를 키우는 농장 & 레스토랑 경영 시뮬레이션입니다. 알록달록한 섬을 탐험하며 재배와 채집, 동물 사육, 낚시, 기계 생산을 즐기고, 배고픈 손님들을 위해 맛있는 레시피를 요리하세요! 꿈의 공간을 건설하고 커스터마이즈하고, 직원을 고용해 유기농 비즈니스를 5성급 레스토랑으로 키워 보세요! 처음부터 건설 컬러풀한 섬이 내려다보이는 해안 언덕 위에 레스토랑을 처음부터 지으세요! 실내·실외 어디든 주방과 농장의 구석구석을 꾸밀 수 있습니다. 벽, 바닥, 창문, 장식, 가구까지 다양한 스타일을 선택하세요. 재배, 사육 & 수확 주방 바로 옆에서 신선한 작물을 키우고 동물을 기르세요! 갓 수확한 농산물을 모으고, 반려동물 친구도 입양할 수 있어요. 수확은 한 번에 하나씩! 요리 & 서빙 요리해 서빙하거나 파머스 마켓에서 판매하세요. 섬의 재료를 찾아 새 레시피를 발견해 보세요! 다양한 메뉴를 만들고, 요리·베이킹·그릴로 풍미 가득한 음식을 제공해 평판을 올리고 더 많은 손님을 끌어오세요! 채집 & 낚시 버섯, 베리 등 다양한 야생 식재료를 채집하거나, 드넓은 바다에서 희귀한 어종을 낚아 보세요! 생산 수확물을 더 고급 재료로 바꿔 주는 유용한 기계를 얻고, 새로운 레시피를 해금하세요. 관리 자원을 관리하고, 셰프·웨이터·농부를 고용해 가게를 업그레이드하고 명성을 키우세요. 농장에서는 천천히, 주방에서는 속도를 올려 아늑한 작은 공간을 5성급 레스토랑으로!"
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
    "en": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm to Table</strong> is a farming and restaurant management sim where you build a restaurant from scratch and grow food in the backyard. Explore a colourful island where you can grow and gather food, raise animals, go fishing, produce better food with machines and cook delicious recipes for your hungry guests! Build and customise your dream place, hire staff and grow your organic business into a 5-star restaurant! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build From Scratch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your restaurant from scratch on a coastal hill overlooking a colorful island! Customize each corner of your kitchen and farm, indoors or outdoors. Choose from a wide variety of wall, flooring, window, decoration, and furniture styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow, Raise &amp; Harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow fresh crops and raise animals right by your kitchen! Collect fresh produce and adopt pet companions. One harvest at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook &amp; Serve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook and Serve or Sell at your Farmers’ Market. Discover new recipes by exploring ingredients on the island! Create diverse menus, cook, bake, grill and serve flavoursome dishes to raise your reputation and attract even more customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather &amp; Fish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather all kinds of wild flavours like mushrooms, berries and much more or go fishing in the open seas for rare catches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Produce</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get useful machines to turn harvest into more advanced ingredients and unlock new recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, hire chefs, waiters and farmers, upgrade and grow the reputation of your place.Take it slow on the farm, then pick up the pace in the kitchen, turn your cozy humble spot into a 5-star restaurant! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "zh-Hant": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm to Table</strong> 是一款农场与餐厅经营模拟游戏：从零开始建造餐厅，在后院种植食材。探索色彩缤纷的小岛，在这里你可以种植与采集食物、饲养动物、出海钓鱼、用机器加工出更高级的食材，并为饥肠辘辘的客人烹饪美味菜谱！建造并自定义你的梦想店铺，雇佣员工，把你的有机事业发展成五星级餐厅！</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>从零开始建造</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在俯瞰彩色小岛的海岸山坡上，从零建起你的餐厅！室内室外都能自由定制，打造厨房与农场的每个角落。多种墙面、地板、窗户、装饰与家具风格任你选择。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>种植、饲养与收获</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >就在厨房旁边种植新鲜作物、饲养动物！收集新鲜农产品，还能领养宠物伙伴。一次一份地收获！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>烹饪与招待</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >烹饪并上桌招待，或在农夫集市出售。探索小岛食材，发现新菜谱！打造多样菜单，烹饪、烘焙、烧烤并端上美味佳肴，提升口碑，吸引更多顾客！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>采集与钓鱼</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >采集蘑菇、浆果等各种野味，或前往外海钓取稀有渔获！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>加工生产</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >获得实用机器，把收获加工成更高级的食材，解锁新菜谱。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>经营管理</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >管理资源，雇佣厨师、服务员与农夫，升级店铺并提升声望。农场慢慢来，厨房加快节奏，把温馨的小店做成五星餐厅！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "zh-Hans": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm to Table</strong> 是一款农场与餐厅经营模拟游戏：从零开始建造餐厅，在后院种植食材。探索色彩缤纷的小岛，在这里你可以种植与采集食物、饲养动物、出海钓鱼、用机器加工出更高级的食材，并为饥肠辘辘的客人烹饪美味菜谱！建造并自定义你的梦想店铺，雇佣员工，把你的有机事业发展成五星级餐厅！</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>从零开始建造</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在俯瞰彩色小岛的海岸山坡上，从零建起你的餐厅！室内室外都能自由定制，打造厨房与农场的每个角落。多种墙面、地板、窗户、装饰与家具风格任你选择。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>种植、饲养与收获</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >就在厨房旁边种植新鲜作物、饲养动物！收集新鲜农产品，还能领养宠物伙伴。一次一份地收获！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>烹饪与招待</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >烹饪并上桌招待，或在农夫集市出售。探索小岛食材，发现新菜谱！打造多样菜单，烹饪、烘焙、烧烤并端上美味佳肴，提升口碑，吸引更多顾客！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>采集与钓鱼</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >采集蘑菇、浆果等各种野味，或前往外海钓取稀有渔获！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>加工生产</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >获得实用机器，把收获加工成更高级的食材，解锁新菜谱。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>经营管理</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >管理资源，雇佣厨师、服务员与农夫，升级店铺并提升声望。农场慢慢来，厨房加快节奏，把温馨的小店做成五星餐厅！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "ja": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「<strong>Farm to Table</strong>」は、ゼロからレストランを作り、裏庭で食材を育てる農業＆レストラン経営シミュレーション。カラフルな島を探索し、栽培・採集・動物飼育・釣り・マシン生産を楽しみながら、空腹のお客さまのために美味しいレシピを調理しよう！理想の空間を建ててカスタマイズし、スタッフを雇い、オーガニックなお店を5つ星レストランへ成長させよう！</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ゼロから建てよう</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >色鮮やかな島を見下ろす海沿いの丘に、レストランをゼロから建設！屋内・屋外どちらも、キッチンと農場の隅々までカスタマイズ。壁、床、窓、装飾、家具など多彩なスタイルから選べる。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>育てて、飼って、収穫</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >キッチンのすぐそばで作物を育て、動物を飼育！新鮮な収穫物を集めたり、ペットの相棒を迎えたり。収穫は一度にひとつずつ！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>料理して、提供</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >料理して提供、またはファーマーズマーケットで販売！島の食材を探検して新レシピを発見しよう。多彩なメニューを作り、調理・ベイク・グリルで美味しい料理を提供して評判アップ、さらにお客さまを呼び込もう！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>採取＆釣り</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >きのこやベリーなどの野生の味を採集したり、外海でレアな魚を釣ったり！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>生産</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >収穫物をより高度な素材に変える便利なマシンを手に入れ、新レシピを解放しよう。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>マネジメント</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >資源を管理し、シェフ・ウェイター・農夫を雇用。拡張しながら評判を高めよう。農場ではのんびり、キッチンではスピードアップ。居心地のいい小さなお店を5つ星へ！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "ko": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm to Table</strong>은 레스토랑을 처음부터 직접 짓고, 뒷마당에서 식재료를 키우는 농장 &amp; 레스토랑 경영 시뮬레이션입니다. 알록달록한 섬을 탐험하며 재배와 채집, 동물 사육, 낚시, 기계 생산을 즐기고, 배고픈 손님들을 위해 맛있는 레시피를 요리하세요! 꿈의 공간을 건설하고 커스터마이즈하고, 직원을 고용해 유기농 비즈니스를 5성급 레스토랑으로 키워 보세요!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>처음부터 건설</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >컬러풀한 섬이 내려다보이는 해안 언덕 위에 레스토랑을 처음부터 지으세요! 실내·실외 어디든 주방과 농장의 구석구석을 꾸밀 수 있습니다. 벽, 바닥, 창문, 장식, 가구까지 다양한 스타일을 선택하세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/e094a2ae3f91767479be553132781799.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >재배, 사육 &amp; 수확</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >주방 바로 옆에서 신선한 작물을 키우고 동물을 기르세요! 갓 수확한 농산물을 모으고, 반려동물 친구도 입양할 수 있어요. 수확은 한 번에 하나씩!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f4d3928f6e1ddcd7d42190066b42371f.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >요리 &amp; 서빙</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >요리해 서빙하거나 파머스 마켓에서 판매하세요. 섬의 재료를 찾아 새 레시피를 발견해 보세요! 다양한 메뉴를 만들고, 요리·베이킹·그릴로 풍미 가득한 음식을 제공해 평판을 올리고 더 많은 손님을 끌어오세요!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/efdb728c1cbaf960879f14f61cbba81e.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>채집 &amp; 낚시</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >버섯, 베리 등 다양한 야생 식재료를 채집하거나, 드넓은 바다에서 희귀한 어종을 낚아 보세요!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/f8b5cca6b9cfa37b9f4bc84ff53926e9.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>생산</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >수확물을 더 고급 재료로 바꿔 주는 유용한 기계를 얻고, 새로운 레시피를 해금하세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/2e5d6f00e05e2d2e4e7381a18989235d.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>관리</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >자원을 관리하고, 셰프·웨이터·농부를 고용해 가게를 업그레이드하고 명성을 키우세요. 농장에서는 천천히, 주방에서는 속도를 올려 아늑한 작은 공간을 5성급 레스토랑으로!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.poster.avif?t=1778338157\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.webm?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/d579608b68889e2e6113e6157df7bae0.mp4?t=1778338157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>"
  }
}
